<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Calculators on Viking Charts</title><link>https://vikingcharts.github.io/calculators/</link><description>Recent content in Calculators on Viking Charts</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="https://vikingcharts.github.io/calculators/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Building Calculator</title><link>https://vikingcharts.github.io/calculators/building-calculator/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://vikingcharts.github.io/calculators/building-calculator/</guid><description>&lt;div class="alert alert-dark mt-3 text-start"&gt;
 &lt;ul class="mb-1"&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;View total Alfr Marble and Gold costs for every building level.&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;Click to toggle individual buildings, or quickly Select All / Deselect All for any level.&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;Checkboxes with a red border indicate &lt;strong&gt;direct dependencies&lt;/strong&gt;. You can also hover over building names to view their dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note for Palace:&lt;/strong&gt; Palace requirements look for dependencies (Wall, Oracle, War Bloc) from the &lt;strong&gt;previous level&lt;/strong&gt; instead of the current level.&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;Totals for each level and the overall Grand Total update instantly as you make changes.&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;Hover over numbers to see full amounts.&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;!-- Grand Totals (UNCHANGED) --&gt;
&lt;div id="grand-totals" class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row p-2 mb-3 align-items-center"&gt;
 &lt;span class="gt-label mb-1 mb-sm-0 me-sm-2"&gt;GRAND TOTAL:&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-1 mb-sm-0 me-2"&gt;
 &lt;img src="https://vikingcharts.github.io/images/icons/alfrmarble.png" class="icon-resource-lg me-1" alt="Alfr Marble"&gt;
 &lt;span id="bc-total-marble" class="fw-bold"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="d-flex align-items-center"&gt;
 &lt;img src="https://vikingcharts.github.io/images/icons/gold.png" class="icon-resource-lg me-1" alt="Gold"&gt;
 &lt;span id="bc-total-gold" class="fw-bold"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id="levels-container"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;!-- ================= TEMPLATES ================= --&gt;
&lt;!-- Accordion Template --&gt;
&lt;template id="level-accordion-template"&gt;
 &lt;div class="accordion my-3"&gt;
 &lt;div class="accordion-item"&gt;
&lt;h2 class="accordion-header"&gt;
&lt;button
 class="accordion-button collapsed"
 type="button"
 data-bs-toggle="collapse"
 data-bs-target="#level-collapse-__LEVEL__"
 aria-expanded="false"
 aria-controls="level-collapse-__LEVEL__"
&gt;
 LEVEL &lt;span class="level-number"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="level-total-marble d-inline-flex align-items-center"&gt;
 &lt;img src="https://vikingcharts.github.io/images/icons/alfrmarble.png" class="bc-icon icon-resource-lg me-1"&gt;
 &lt;span class="level-marble-value"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="level-total-gold d-inline-flex align-items-center"&gt;
 &lt;img src="https://vikingcharts.github.io/images/icons/gold.png" class="bc-icon icon-resource-lg me-1"&gt;
 &lt;span class="level-gold-value"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div
id="level-collapse-__LEVEL__"
class="accordion-collapse collapse"
&gt;
&lt;div class="accordion-body"&gt;
 &lt;div class="mb-2"&gt;
 &lt;button class="btn btn-sm link-button select-all"&gt;Select All&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;button class="btn btn-sm link-button deselect-all"&gt;Deselect All&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="bc-table-wrapper table-responsive table-scrollable"&gt;
 &lt;table class="table table-sm table-hover mb-0"&gt;
 &lt;thead&gt;
 &lt;tr&gt;
 &lt;th style="width:55px;"&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;th class="building-column text-start"&gt;Building&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;th class="text-end"&gt;Alfr Marble&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;th class="text-end"&gt;Gold&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
 &lt;/thead&gt;
 &lt;tbody class="buildings-body"&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;
 &lt;/table&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/template&gt;
&lt;template id="building-row-template"&gt;
 &lt;tr&gt;
 &lt;td class="text-center"&gt;
 &lt;input type="checkbox" class="building-checkbox"&gt;
 &lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;td class="text-start building-name"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;td class="text-end marble-cell"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;td class="text-end gold-cell"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/template&gt;</description></item><item><title>Secret Knowledge: Third Stage</title><link>https://vikingcharts.github.io/calculators/secret-knowledge-calculator/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://vikingcharts.github.io/calculators/secret-knowledge-calculator/</guid><description>&lt;div class="alert alert-dark mt-3 text-start"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;Costs update automatically based on the selected &lt;strong&gt;Knowledge Tree&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Upgrade Cost Level&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Secret Knowledge Cost Summary section&lt;/strong&gt; is collapsed by default. Select an Upgrade Cost Level for each Knowledge Tree to calculate the total cost of all Knowledges. The selected upgrade levels are automatically applied to the &lt;strong&gt;Knowledge Upgrade Cost per Level&lt;/strong&gt; section.&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge Upgrade Cost per Level section:&lt;/strong&gt; Each Knowledge Tree shows how many Level 10 and Level 5 upgrades it contains.&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;Select an Upgrade Cost Level for each Knowledge Tree. The cost table updates automatically and displays the cost per Knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;Enter how many Knowledges you want to upgrade at each level. The &lt;strong&gt;Total&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Grand Total&lt;/strong&gt; update automatically.&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;The badge next to each Knowledge title shows the currently selected Upgrade Cost Level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div class="accordion mb-4" id="sk3SummaryAccordion"&gt;
 &lt;div class="accordion-item"&gt;
 &lt;!-- Header --&gt; 
 &lt;h2 class="accordion-header pt-0" id="sk3SummaryHeading"&gt; &lt;button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#sk3SummaryCollapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sk3SummaryCollapse"&gt; Secret Knowledge Third Stage Cost Summary &lt;/button&gt; &lt;/h2&gt;
 &lt;!-- Collapsible Body --&gt; 
 &lt;div id="sk3SummaryCollapse" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="sk3SummaryHeading" data-bs-parent="#sk3SummaryAccordion"&gt;
 &lt;div class="accordion-body card-body"&gt;
 &lt;div class="table-responsive"&gt;
 &lt;table class="table table-bordered table-hover align-middle"&gt;
 &lt;thead class="table-light"&gt;
 &lt;tr&gt;
 &lt;th class="text-start"&gt;Knowledge&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;th class="text-start" style="width: 180px;"&gt;Upgrade Cost&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;th&gt; Chaos&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;th&gt;Gold&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
 &lt;/thead&gt;
 &lt;tbody id="knowledgeTable"&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;
 &lt;tfoot class="table-light fw-bold"&gt;
 &lt;tr&gt;
 &lt;td colspan="2" class="text-end"&gt;Total*&lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;td id="totalChaos"&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;td id="totalGold"&gt;0&lt;/td&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
 &lt;/tfoot&gt;
 &lt;/table&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="mt-2 small text-muted"&gt; &lt;em&gt; *Totals are calculated only when each Knowledge has a unique Upgrade Cost level selected. &lt;/em&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="mt-4"&gt;
&lt;h5 class="pb-3 pt-3 knowledge-title"&gt;Knowledge Upgrade Cost per Level&lt;/h5&gt;
 &lt;div class="knowledge-levels-conatiner"&gt;
 &lt;div class="mb-3 p-3"&gt;
 &lt;div class="fw-bold d-flex justify-content-between"&gt;
 &lt;span&gt;Grand Total&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span&gt;
 &lt;span id="grandChaos"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span id="grandGold"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="accordion" id="knowledgeCostAccordion"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>VIP Calculator</title><link>https://vikingcharts.github.io/calculators/vip-calculator/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://vikingcharts.github.io/calculators/vip-calculator/</guid><description>&lt;div class="alert alert-dark mt-3 text-start"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;VIP 60-100 Cost Calculator and Bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;Enter your current VIP points or select your current VIP level to calculate points needed for your next VIP level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;!-- Level Selectors --&gt;
&lt;div class="row g-3 mb-4"&gt;
 &lt;div class="col-md-4"&gt;
 &lt;label for="vip-points-input" class="form-label fw-semibold"&gt; Enter Current VIP Points&lt;/label&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" id="vip-points-input" class="form-control" placeholder="Enter points (optional)"&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="col-md-4"&gt;
 &lt;label for="vip-current" class="form-label fw-semibold"&gt;Current VIP Level&lt;/label&gt;
 &lt;select id="vip-current" class="form-select"&gt;&lt;/select&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="col-md-4"&gt;
 &lt;label for="vip-target" class="form-label fw-semibold"&gt;Target VIP Level&lt;/label&gt;
 &lt;select id="vip-target" class="form-select"&gt;&lt;/select&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;!-- Results --&gt;
&lt;div id="vip-results" class="d-none"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;h2&gt; VIP Bonuses&lt;/h2&gt;
 &lt;button id="toggle-changed" class="btn button-click"&gt;
 Show Only Bonuses that change
 &lt;/button&gt;
&lt;!-- Bonus Tables Wrapper --&gt;
&lt;div id="vip-bonus-tables"&gt;
 &lt;!-- Tabs for Bonuses --&gt;
 &lt;ul class="nav nav-tabs my-4" id="bonusTabs" role="tablist"&gt;
 &lt;li class="nav-item" role="presentation"&gt;
 &lt;button class="nav-link active" id="military-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#military" type="button" role="tab"&gt;
 Military Bonuses
 &lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li class="nav-item" role="presentation"&gt;
 &lt;button class="nav-link" id="economy-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#economy" type="button" role="tab"&gt;
 Economy Bonuses
 &lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;/ul&gt;
 &lt;div class="tab-content"&gt;
 &lt;!-- Military --&gt;
 &lt;div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="military" role="tabpanel"&gt;
 &lt;div class="table-wrapper table-responsive table-scrollable"&gt;
 &lt;table class="table table-striped table-scrollable--sticky-header table-borderless align-middle"&gt;
 &lt;thead class="table-primary"&gt;
 &lt;tr&gt;
 &lt;th class="text-start"&gt;Bonus&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;th id="current-vip-header-mil"&gt;Current&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;th id="target-vip-header-mil"&gt;Target&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;th&gt;Difference&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
 &lt;/thead&gt;
 &lt;tbody id="military-bonus-body"&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;
 &lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;!-- Economy --&gt;
 &lt;div class="tab-pane fade" id="economy" role="tabpanel"&gt;
 &lt;div class="table-wrapper table-responsive table-scrollable"&gt;
 &lt;table class="table table-striped table-scrollable--sticky-header table-borderless align-middle"&gt;
 &lt;thead class="table-success"&gt;
 &lt;tr&gt;
 &lt;th class="text-start"&gt;Bonus&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;th id="current-vip-header-eco"&gt;Current&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;th id="target-vip-header-eco"&gt;Target&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;th&gt;Difference&lt;/th&gt;
 &lt;/tr&gt;
 &lt;/thead&gt;
 &lt;tbody id="economy-bonus-body"&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;
 &lt;/table&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>